  <item>
    <title>04 | 年轻人无处安放的情绪，在AI时代有了去处 | 对话「林间聊愈室」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6729d220b2eb246ec4cfe470</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6729d220b2eb246ec4cfe470</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2024 08:26:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkfD9_oFI28xAXGQpTz8IwIRGuhC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>对成年人来说，表达情绪是一件不被鼓励的事，尤其是负面情绪。情绪稳定，成为越来越多人追求的一种“舒适的状态”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是慢慢地，表达情绪变成了一件不那么容易的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>然而，未被表达的情绪不会凭空消失，如何处理我们“无处安放”的情绪？有没有一个地方可以让我们安全地倾诉？或许林间聊愈室给出了还不错的答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一款 AI 心理疗愈应用，林间聊愈室中有三只可爱的小动物，倾听大家的情绪、理解用户的处境。精准地切中了大家愿意为萌物买单的需求，尤其是能够提供情绪价值的萌物！在Z世代中颇受欢迎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时作为阶跃星辰开放平台的繁星计划伙伴，本期播客我们邀请了 Joshua 和我们一起分享在 AI 时代，如何做好一款心理陪伴产品。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>李神龙 Joshua</span></p><span></span><p><span>连续创业者，拥有超过10年针对Z世代的精神和文娱产品研发经验，曾担任Z世代二次元元创作社区【触漫】COO兼联合创始人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>林间聊愈室@ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65237649000000002b0032ec?xsec_token=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65237649000000002b0032ec?xsec_token=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>林间聊愈室</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Bianca @</span><a href="https://m.okjike.com/users/EBD738D8-9605-4433-A97E-29B6DA422D5D?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIiwiZCI6MX0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/users/EBD738D8-9605-4433-A97E-29B6DA422D5D?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIiwiZCI6MX0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card"><span>KK_77</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>孙然 @</span><a href="https://m.okjike.com/users/d21f0d51-c394-41bf-b999-1f631530fb88?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIiwiZCI6Mn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/users/d21f0d51-c394-41bf-b999-1f631530fb88?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIiwiZCI6Mn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card"><span>Megan_Ran</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目策划制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>雅琦，阶跃星辰开放平台运营 @</span><a href="https://m.okjike.com/users/E5862B64-4CAE-44C0-B1DB-41A89B65C54A?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/users/E5862B64-4CAE-44C0-B1DB-41A89B65C54A?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card"><span>Yaqi_DIY</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>泡泡鱼，后期剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 林间聊愈室是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 从 NLP 到 LLM，从心岛日记到林间聊愈室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> Z世代普遍面临的心理困境以及情绪消费需求是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> 半路出家，非专业心理学者 + AI 外行人组成的团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> UI 设计为什么如此精致？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 为什么选择三只小动物作为心理聊愈师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 林间聊愈室和心理咨询师在定位上的差异？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 产品设计如何帮助用户更好的表达？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> AI 心理疗愈产品有哪些？林间聊愈室的定位是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 目前用户对 AI 心理陪伴产品的接受程度如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a> 人类与 AI 之间，健康的陪伴和依赖之间的边界是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> 如何看待有的产品通过让用户沉溺其中来获取商业利益？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 从技术侧来看，AI是如何准确识别用户情绪，做出共情并给出回应的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a> 用户故事分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> 上线 AI 识图，一个被用户催出来的功能！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a> 选择阶跃大模型的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a> 海外产品实现ROI打正，怎么做到的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 国内和国外用户对于产品的需求有何不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 怎么让用户知道你的产品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 产品的付费点在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 即将上线的新功能预告！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2982">49:42</a> 林间聊愈室会逐渐演变成社区产品吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3550">59:10</a> &nbsp;产品中哪个细节是你最满意的？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【关注我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/知乎：阶跃星辰开放平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入开发者交流群，一起探索更多AI的可能性！</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
