  <item>
    <title>02 | 对话「小胰宝」：微光传递力量，与5000名患者温暖同行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d03c94d06ec988f2b5db41</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d03c94d06ec988f2b5db41</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 09:17:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对于癌症二字，人们总是谈之色变，避之不及。</span></p><span></span><p><span>尽管医疗技术日益精进，但一直到现在仍没有完美的解决办法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>胰腺癌，是一种起源于胰腺的恶性肿瘤。因其起病隐匿，发展迅速，恶性程度高，生存率低，而被称为“癌中之王”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sam 是一位资深企业数字化解决方案专家，同时也是一位胰腺癌患者，更是一位具有极客精神的 AI 应用开发者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对患病的打击，Sam 并没有一蹶不振，而是又一次拿出了自己的解决方案。他开发出了</span><a href="https://ai.xiaoyibao.com.cn/chat/share?shareId=2es90tdmri9wrgznq797pkm1" data-url="https://ai.xiaoyibao.com.cn/chat/share?shareId=2es90tdmri9wrgznq797pkm1"><span>小胰宝</span></a><span>，一个面向胰腺癌肿瘤患者的智能 RAG 平台，服务上千位患者，赋予人工智能以温度，为科技向善的篇章写下生动的注脚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们与 Sam 的结缘源于一次日常的用户回访，我们被 Sam 积极乐观的态度所感染，期待能与小胰宝一起帮助到更多的人，由此阶跃迅速决定为小胰宝及其连带项目提供免费的大模型支持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期繁星创想录，我们邀请 Sam 和他的团队伙伴晓乐，小胰宝的运营负责人，一起来聊聊关于小胰宝的诞生及发展。希望通过这个内容能够聚集到更多的微光力量，也把这份光明传递给更多的人。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Sam：资深企业数字化解决方案专家，</span><a href="https://ai.xiaoyibao.com.cn/chat/share?shareId=2es90tdmri9wrgznq797pkm1" data-url="https://ai.xiaoyibao.com.cn/chat/share?shareId=2es90tdmri9wrgznq797pkm1"><span>小胰宝</span></a><span>开发者</span></p><span></span><p><span>柴晓乐：小胰宝运营团队负责人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c8afd130000000010013957" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c8afd130000000010013957"><span>小胰宝</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Github:</span><a href="https://github.com/PancrePal-xiaoyibao/PancrePal-xiaoyibao/blob/main/README.md" data-url="https://github.com/PancrePal-xiaoyibao/PancrePal-xiaoyibao/blob/main/README.md"><span>“小胰宝 - 面向胰腺癌肿瘤患者的智能RAG平台”</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>付凯，阶跃星辰开放平台负责人，即刻@</span><a href="http://m.okjike.com/users/A904CC1C-EF93-4AD1-8D25-C3AE705CF636?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;utm_source=user_card" data-url="http://m.okjike.com/users/A904CC1C-EF93-4AD1-8D25-C3AE705CF636?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;utm_source=user_card"><span>Sunnyfu.eth</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Simin，阶跃星辰开放平台产品经理，即刻@</span><a href="https://m.okjike.com/users/6058BCAB-31E4-4800-BB1E-CF1A0C13EE47?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/users/6058BCAB-31E4-4800-BB1E-CF1A0C13EE47?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card"><span>Simin一尘</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目策划制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>雅琦，阶跃星辰开放平台运营，即刻@</span><a href="https://m.okjike.com/users/E5862B64-4CAE-44C0-B1DB-41A89B65C54A?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/users/E5862B64-4CAE-44C0-B1DB-41A89B65C54A?ref=PROFILE_CARD&amp;source=user_card&amp;s=eyJ1IjoiNjY4ZDAzMTg0ODNiZmNlYWM2NDExNzQwIn0%3D&amp;utm_source=user_card"><span>Green Uei7</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>泡泡鱼，后期剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 抗癌就像爬山，一直朝上走，见到光和风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 所谓的“神医”真的靠谱吗？求仙问卜，不如自己做主！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 小胰宝诞生的契机是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 小胰宝的产品特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 小胰宝是最早接入阶跃模型能力的应用之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 两个原则：不触碰诊疗，不做全癌种产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 接入 Step-1v 开发病情提醒功能，实现 0-1 重要场景突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 病友最关注的问题是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> 项目运营中遇到的挑战和故事分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> 被告知只能活三个月，小胰宝团队一对一弥补信息差，找到正确的治疗方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2936">48:56</a> 患癌后依旧热爱生活，在社媒上输出正能量的 Tina</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 当我想要放弃的时候，儿子的话激励了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3399">56:39</a> 对“养生操”和“弹舌”上头的患癌老人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3726">1:02:06</a> 小胰宝团队规模和分工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3837">1:03:57</a> 未来 AI+ 医疗公益项目的探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4181">1:09:41</a> AI+ 医疗公益项目落地需要什么样的土壤？大厂真的比小企业好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4299">1:11:39</a> 微光吸引微光，普通人聚集一起成就善举</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4821">1:20:21</a> 小胰宝目前最需要的帮助：助力跨癌肿应用开发的提示词工程师/志愿者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【小胰宝官方病友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrtCKHvG6OH-q25sP4ZTZr9pJMXt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【关注我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/知乎：阶跃星辰开放平台</span></p>]]></description>
